# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Without this, a cold visit to any deep link — billtap.app/restaurants from the
# flyer QR, or /r/<slug> from a table tent — hits Cloudflare as a missing file
# and 404s before React ever boots.
#
# Pages Functions are matched before these rules, so /api/** is unaffected:
# /api/apps/** proxies to Base44 and the rest are this app's own endpoints. That
# is what makes a blanket rule safe here — do not add one without that proxy in
# place, or every data call in the app will be served index.html instead.
/*    /index.html    200
